type: software
title: "Biomedical Research Skills for Claude Code"
abstract: >-
  A curated pack of senior-level skills for Claude Code targeted at biomedical
  researchers: clinical writing, medical imaging methodology, statistical
  reporting, fellowship and grant applications, scientific software
  engineering, medical hardware design, and open source contribution.
